    "description": "<p><strong>Psionic</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to force a ravenous swarm of insects to burst from the target flesh. The target takes <strong>d8+4</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency. All other targets within Very Close range of the them must make a Reaction Roll (13). On a failure, they take <strong>2d8+2</strong> kinetic damage.</p>",
